{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Hexcavator",
    "steam_appid": 3440310,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440310/extras/4c32a077cd22bfb2428e3bf20803c162.avif?t=1752344943\" data-has-big width=800 height=577 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexcavator is a charming, 3D, reimagining of Minesweeper, with hexagonal grids, upgrades, rich cosmetics, and a focus on feeling comfy.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca3CORE GAMEPLAY\ud83d\udca3</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle solving on a colourful 3D hex grid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear tiles, dodge mines, and collect iron, gold, and rare crystals for money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your money to unlock cool new cosmetics!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udea9PROGRESSION\ud83d\udea9</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple upgrades to make gameplay more accessible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements for completionists</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca3CUSTOMIZATION\ud83d\udca3</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a wide variety of visual themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique flags</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned resources on personalizing the look of the world</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udea9Atmosphere\ud83d\udea9</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft, playful art style with low-poly charm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soothing background sounds</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca3&quot;I just want classic Minesweeper...&quot;\ud83d\udca3</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No problem! Classic Mode turns off all upgrades for pure, traditional gameplay.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440310/extras/4c32a077cd22bfb2428e3bf20803c162.avif?t=1752344943\" data-has-big width=800 height=577 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexcavator is a charming, 3D, reimagining of Minesweeper, with hexagonal grids, upgrades, rich cosmetics, and a focus on feeling comfy.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca3CORE GAMEPLAY\ud83d\udca3</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle solving on a colourful 3D hex grid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear tiles, dodge mines, and collect iron, gold, and rare crystals for money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your money to unlock cool new cosmetics!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udea9PROGRESSION\ud83d\udea9</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple upgrades to make gameplay more accessible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements for completionists</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca3CUSTOMIZATION\ud83d\udca3</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a wide variety of visual themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique flags</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned resources on personalizing the look of the world</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udea9Atmosphere\ud83d\udea9</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft, playful art style with low-poly charm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soothing background sounds</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca3&quot;I just want classic Minesweeper...&quot;\ud83d\udca3</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No problem! Classic Mode turns off all upgrades for pure, traditional gameplay.</p>",
    "short_description": "\u26cf\ufe0f A fresh take on Minesweeper with hexagonal grids and treasure hunting! Clear tiles, collect resources, and unlock a huge collection of themes and flags. Soothing sounds and atmospheric visuals make every session a delight. Of course, featuring a classic mode available for purists! \ud83d\udc8e",
